  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "关于论文《An Interactive Machine Translation Framework for Modernizing Historical Documents》，What kind of data is used to train the model?",
      "turn_id": "e8b6f22340b84f8a89a97862b7341d79"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": {
        "claims": [
          {
            "key": "corpora_used",
            "text": "The experiments used three corpora: the Dutch Bible, El Quijote, and El Conde Lucanor.",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1910.03355",
                "chunk_id": "c-2b39005de67979a14fc26cd7"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "dutch_bible_versions",
            "text": "For the Dutch Bible, the 1637 version was treated as the original document and the 1888 version as modern Dutch.",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1910.03355",
                "chunk_id": "c-2b39005de67979a14fc26cd7"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "el_quijote_data",
            "text": "The El Quijote corpus contains the 17th century Spanish novel and its corresponding 21st century version.",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1910.03355",
                "chunk_id": "c-2b39005de67979a14fc26cd7"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "el_conde_lucanor_data",
            "text": "The El Conde Lucanor data set contains the original 14th century Spanish novel and its corresponding 21st century version.",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1910.03355",
                "chunk_id": "c-2b39005de67979a14fc26cd7"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "el_conde_lucanor_test_only",
            "text": "Because of its small size, El Conde Lucanor was used only as a test; the systems built for El Quijote were used to modernize it since no suitable training corpus was found.",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1910.03355",
                "chunk_id": "c-2b39005de67979a14fc26cd7"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "small_training_corpora",
            "text": "The paper notes the small size of the training corpora as a likely reason SMT outperformed NMT.",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1910.03355",
                "chunk_id": "c-98f92e50001a68c58a20c08e"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "nmt_parallel_corpora",
            "text": "In NMT, model parameters are estimated on large parallel corpora using stochastic gradient descent.",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1910.03355",
                "chunk_id": "c-ab6e4f648559a50bb0a797c2"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "parallel_corpus_in_related_work",
            "text": "In related work, a prior NMT approach extracted parallel phrases from an original parallel corpus and used them as additional training data.",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1910.03355",
                "chunk_id": "c-e0fab0266b412df784700e67"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "decision": "answer"
      },
      "turn_id": "e8b6f22340b84f8a89a97862b7341d79"
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "请解释刚才那篇论文对于这个问题的证据，保留引用；不能从常识补充结论。",
      "turn_id": "0ac2a1d7c9094531a02864300bef1f04"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": {
        "claims": [
          {
            "key": "training_corpora",
            "text": "论文使用的实验语料包括荷兰圣经（Dutch Bible）、El Quijote 和 El Conde Lucanor；其中荷兰圣经使用 1637 年版作为原文、1888 年版作为现代荷兰语版本。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1910.03355",
                "chunk_id": "c-2b39005de67979a14fc26cd7"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "el_quijote_corpus",
            "text": "El Quijote 语料包含 17 世纪西班牙语原著及其对应的 21 世纪版本。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1910.03355",
                "chunk_id": "c-2b39005de67979a14fc26cd7"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "conde_test_only",
            "text": "El Conde Lucanor 语料规模小，因此作者决定仅将其用作测试集。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1910.03355",
                "chunk_id": "c-2b39005de67979a14fc26cd7"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "conde_borrow_quijote_systems",
            "text": "由于找不到合适的训练语料，作者使用为 El Quijote 构建的系统来现代化 El Conde Lucanor，尽管两者原文属于不同时期。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1910.03355",
                "chunk_id": "c-2b39005de67979a14fc26cd7"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "conde_quality_exception",
            "text": "El Conde Lucanor 是现代化质量结果中的例外：SMT 在 TER 上有显著改善但在 BLEU 上更差，NMT 在 BLEU 和 TER 两方面结果都最差。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1910.03355",
                "chunk_id": "c-98f92e50001a68c58a20c08e"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "conde_quality_cause",
            "text": "作者认为 El Conde Lucanor 的这些结果很可能源于使用了以 El Quijote 训练的系统来对其进行现代化。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1910.03355",
                "chunk_id": "c-98f92e50001a68c58a20c08e"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "smt_better_all_cases",
            "text": "在比较 SMT 与 NMT 时，SMT 在所有情况下都取得了最好的结果。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1910.03355",
                "chunk_id": "c-98f92e50001a68c58a20c08e"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "small_training_corpus_explains_smt",
            "text": "作者指出 SMT 优于 NMT 的行为很可能是因为训练语料规模小，这是 NMT 中已知的问题。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1910.03355",
                "chunk_id": "c-98f92e50001a68c58a20c08e"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "conde_effort_increase",
            "text": "对于 El Conde Lucanor，SMT 和 NMT 两种方法都导致生成无错误现代版本所需的人工投入增加；作者认为这是预期之中的，因为其现代化质量很低，系统持续生成错误后缀，用户不得不做更多修改。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1910.03355",
                "chunk_id": "c-98f92e50001a68c58a20c08e"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "decision": "answer"
      },
      "turn_id": "0ac2a1d7c9094531a02864300bef1f04"
    },
